          </p>

          <div class="border-l-4 border-score-warning bg-surface-secondary/40 p-5 rounded-r-xl my-6">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-primary mb-1">Over-Compression Risk</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Stripping essential context or removing clarifying adjectives can make instructions ambiguous, leading to lower-quality LLM generations. Optimization rules should never alter variable placeholders (<code class="font-mono text-primary">&#123;user_id&#125;</code>) or exact JSON format specifications.
            </p>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">When NOT to Compress Prompts</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
