              <h4 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-1">1. Exact Legal or Policy Verbatim</h4>
              <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Do not trim legal terms of service, compliance disclaimers, or exact policy guidelines where precise phrasing is legally required.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface border border-border">
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-1">2. Delicate Tone & Empathy Instructions</h4>
